# oracle: pair lubricate flaglog 1 flagfld 0 flagHI 1 flagVF 1 on 125 spheres of diameter 0.6 (sc lattice, 5x5x5 cells, periodic 3d box), 20 nve/sphere steps: the Ball-Melrose log terms, the pumping torque and the volume fraction terms
# native: installed lmp (b332f28)
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 3.1e-15, atoms 2.9e-14.
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
units           lj
atom_style      sphere
boundary        p p p
lattice         sc 0.3
region          box block 0 5 0 5 0 5
create_box      1 box
create_atoms    1 box
set             type 1 diameter 0.6
velocity        all create 1.0 4928 loop geom
neighbor        1.0 bin
neigh_modify    delay 0 every 1 check yes
comm_modify     vel yes
timestep        0.001
fix             1 all nve/sphere
pair_style      lubricate 1.5 1 0 0.61 2.5 1 1
pair_coeff      * *
thermo_style    custom step temp press vol
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          5
run             20
